    "name": "Into The Depths",
    "steam_appid": 3705150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of an expedition into the Depths. Your mission is to <strong>colonize</strong> the underground, <strong>extract precious minerals, </strong>and <strong>survive the dangers lurking below.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Outpost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/eece4cbc760efa0116eb13ec6a71e950.poster.avif?t=1747402401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/eece4cbc760efa0116eb13ec6a71e950.webm?t=1747402401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/eece4cbc760efa0116eb13ec6a71e950.mp4?t=1747402401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, place a tile around your central base to expand your settlement and gain vital resources. The tiles are drawn randomly, presenting <strong>tough choices</strong> and <strong>unpredictable challenges</strong>. But remember \u2014 the fate is yours to decide.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many dangers in the deep caverns, but the most important challenge is to provide your outpost with <strong>food</strong>. The larger your settlement becomes and the deeper you go, the harder it is to keep everyone fed. <strong>Place farms and</strong>\u00a0<strong>grow mushroom plantations</strong> when the food supplies run low, or your expedition may become one of the many lost in the darkness.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the many resources, the mysterious blue crystals are the most valuable. Their unique properties allow you to\u00a0<strong>unlock new tiles</strong> and\u00a0<strong>upgrade your outpost</strong>. Collect enough of them, and the Alchemist will provide you with <strong>powerful upgrades</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/74edf0a6ab05a631eb1d12307684f86e.avif?t=1747402401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine for Riches</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't forget that your main goal is <strong>to claim the riches</strong> buried underground. Build mines, search for ore deposits, and expand your settlement to get more gold. Without it, you can't fund your expedition and delve deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Carefully</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile\u2019s reward depends on where you place it. Thoughtful placement can unlock <strong>powerful synergies</strong> and turn the tide in your favor!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance between mining and keeping everyone alive and well. Plan the development of your outpost. Expand. Colonize.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/9773f62c310a9ba7dd9f2de7f22f042e.avif?t=1747402401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Depths is a perilous and ever-changing realm that hides tons of wealth.  As you go down, you'll see that the environment changes. From the rocky and barren <strong>Upper Levels</strong>, through the foggy <strong>Humid Caves</strong> and scorching\u00a0<strong>Magma Caverns,</strong>\u00a0to the deepest <strong>Abyss:</strong> each biome offers new resources and challenges to overcome. But beware\u00a0of the dangers lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start over!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated caves and a vast number of technologies to choose from will affect your playstyle and make each of the expeditions unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous expeditions failed to conquer the Depths, and yours is no exception. Learn from your mistakes, gather knowledge, find new technologies, and become stronger. Only the most iron-willed will return in fame and glory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of an expedition into the Depths. Your mission is to <strong>colonize</strong> the underground, <strong>extract precious minerals, </strong>and <strong>survive the dangers lurking below.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Outpost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/eece4cbc760efa0116eb13ec6a71e950.poster.avif?t=1747402401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/eece4cbc760efa0116eb13ec6a71e950.webm?t=1747402401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/eece4cbc760efa0116eb13ec6a71e950.mp4?t=1747402401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, place a tile around your central base to expand your settlement and gain vital resources. The tiles are drawn randomly, presenting <strong>tough choices</strong> and <strong>unpredictable challenges</strong>. But remember \u2014 the fate is yours to decide.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many dangers in the deep caverns, but the most important challenge is to provide your outpost with <strong>food</strong>. The larger your settlement becomes and the deeper you go, the harder it is to keep everyone fed. <strong>Place farms and</strong>\u00a0<strong>grow mushroom plantations</strong> when the food supplies run low, or your expedition may become one of the many lost in the darkness.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the many resources, the mysterious blue crystals are the most valuable. Their unique properties allow you to\u00a0<strong>unlock new tiles</strong> and\u00a0<strong>upgrade your outpost</strong>. Collect enough of them, and the Alchemist will provide you with <strong>powerful upgrades</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/74edf0a6ab05a631eb1d12307684f86e.avif?t=1747402401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine for Riches</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't forget that your main goal is <strong>to claim the riches</strong> buried underground. Build mines, search for ore deposits, and expand your settlement to get more gold. Without it, you can't fund your expedition and delve deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Carefully</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile\u2019s reward depends on where you place it. Thoughtful placement can unlock <strong>powerful synergies</strong> and turn the tide in your favor!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance between mining and keeping everyone alive and well. Plan the development of your outpost. Expand. Colonize.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705150/extras/9773f62c310a9ba7dd9f2de7f22f042e.avif?t=1747402401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Depths is a perilous and ever-changing realm that hides tons of wealth.  As you go down, you'll see that the environment changes. From the rocky and barren <strong>Upper Levels</strong>, through the foggy <strong>Humid Caves</strong> and scorching\u00a0<strong>Magma Caverns,</strong>\u00a0to the deepest <strong>Abyss:</strong> each biome offers new resources and challenges to overcome. But beware\u00a0of the dangers lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start over!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated caves and a vast number of technologies to choose from will affect your playstyle and make each of the expeditions unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous expeditions failed to conquer the Depths, and yours is no exception. Learn from your mistakes, gather knowledge, find new technologies, and become stronger. Only the most iron-willed will return in fame and glory.</p>",
    "short_description": "A roguelike city builder, where you colonize the mysterious underworld. Build your settlement, explore the caves and colonize the deepest caverns. Overcome the dangers hidden in the dark and make the riches of the Depths yours!",
